   "section": "tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/other.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "You fire a special hook shot with your steamgun(s) at a target creature or location.\n\t\tIf you target a creature, they are pulled up to %d tiles towards you.\n\t\tIf you target an empty tile, you are pulled up to %d tiles towards it.\n\t\tThis talent does not use ammo as it is the ammo.",
   "target": "你使用蒸汽枪向目标生物或位置发射一枚特殊钩链弹。\n\t\t如果目标是生物，它会被向你拉动最多 %d 格。\n\t\t如果目标是一块空地，你会被向该位置拉动最多 %d 格。\n\t\t这个技能不使用弹药，因为它本身就是弹药。",
   "source_file": "/workspace/tome4-dlcs/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/other.lua (unpinned public DLC checkout)",
   "source_lines": [
    1603
